  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.HangOutWithKiha.KihaLandsWithGreataxe": "[pg]Kiha lands beside you, leaning heavily on her fiery greataxe. [say: Don't you worry, doofus,] she says, reaching over to run a hand playfully through your hair. [say: You don't have to worry about a thing while Kiha's around.] Suddenly, she turns to the forest at large and roars: [say: You hear that, monsters--this one is mine! MINE! So hands off or you'll have ME to deal with, got it?]"
