  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.InviteKihaForDickings.LeanTreeInvite": "You lean back against a tree and ask the haughty dragoness if she would like to come to your camp... maybe even stay a while. She stops for a moment to consider, her hands clenching nervously as she digests the delicious news. Looking back your way, her eyes brighten, her face lifts, and she cheers, [say: REALLY!?]"
