  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.InviteKihaForDickings.ReptilianCoughsNervously": "[pg]The reptilian woman coughs nervously and attempts to salvage what little is left of her haughty exterior, saying, [say: I... uh, mean, I guess, if you haven't totally fucked it up.] Her vertically slit pupils seem to twinkle with amusement as she says so, and though you can tell she doesn't mean it, you aren't particularly inclined to take the insult after making such an important offer."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.InviteKihaForDickings.SnifflesFavorRequest": "[pg]Kiha sniffles softly and continues, [say: I almost feel bad for Lethice to have you as an enemy. Do me a favor and kick her in the twat for me when you find her, okay?] You both share a nervous laugh at that and slowly end the hug. Dabbing at one of her tears, you suggest, [say: Come on, let's carry your stuff over and get you moved in.] Kiha's tail wags happily, and the two of you begin gathering her things."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.InviteKihaForDickings.SorrySeeCamp": "[pg][say: No...[name], I... I'm sorry. I would love to see your camp,] she says as she snuggles her tears away on your shoulder. She pauses and whispers to you, still holding you tight, [say: Don't leave me alone, please... I-I... I love you.] You tenderly stroke her ruby locks as she confesses her feelings, [say: I sh-should've told you sooner--I almost did. It's so hard to trust anyone out here, so very hard. I mean... I'm fucked up... the demons broke me in so many ways. I still don't even know who I am, and you... you put up with my shit. You fought me tooth and nail, but you didn't hold it against me. You kept coming back, and never let me despair alone. I love you, [name], and don't you forget it.]"
