  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson.KihaHesitantGlance": "[pg][say: My cooking is for you only, Doofus... but you make some good points,] she looks away, seemingly hesitant about other people besides you tasting her cooking. Thinking on the fly, you mention that Amily is pretty intimidated by how fierce and powerful Kiha is, and this would be a great time put her at ease since you know better than anyone that Kiha is kind and thoughtful person inside."
