  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.AmilyExplainsTasting": "[pg]Amily blinks in silence for a moment before answering. [say: Ah, no, it's actually so we can try a few different recipes, and just in case we accidentally mess up! Hello, Kiha.] The mouse may be biting off more than she can chew if this start is anything to go by."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.AmilyPraisesHeat": "[pg]Amily lets out a contented hum. [say: That's good, very spot-on with how hot you got it! A little less cooked on the second half, but that fire breath must be incredibly convenient for cooking!] She seems genuinely excited about this."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.AmilySetsPan": "[pg]Amily sets a pan over the fire nearby and begins to explain how much tougher it is to get the heat right by conventional means. Although Kiha knows the basics of cooking over a proper fire as well, she seems deeply interested in the depth of explanation Amily is able to give. They really are bonding over this."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.AmilyWavesFrantic": "[pg]Likely thinking the same thing as you, Amily waves her arms frantically. [say: Wait! Wait--we need to cook <b>together</b>, sharing our methods, learning how the other does it. Try to cook just one half of a fish fillet?] With remarkable speed, the mouse grabs a knife and cleanly cuts a fillet in two, setting it aside near Kiha. A small single target should help keep Kiha from engulfing the entire table in fire as well making sure she doesn't accidentally overcook everything at once. The minute scale of cooking appears to be a novel concept as the dragonmorph furrows her brow at the small piece of fish. She lifts it, taking a breath, and blows a flame across it, turning it to encompass all sides. The mouse looks happily impressed by the evenness of the torching. Another swift cut further divides it, allowing her a bite-sized chunk for herself and one for Kiha, whom she offers to."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.AwkwardAmilyGreeting": "[pg][say: Oh, right, hello Amily.] Kiha says with a tinge of awkwardness. It really shows how little they hang out when you're busy. [say: If that's the way we're doing this, I'll show you how a dragon sears some meat!] Her sudden confidence reminds you she's not one to show any weakness to others, but a big gust of flames seems like a bad way to start off."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.FishAndHerbAroma": "The smell of fresh fish and herbs along with the sight of a myriad of other ingredients greets you as you approach Amily. She's managed to lay out quite an assortment, enough for many meals, in preparation for possible trial and error."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.KihaAsksAboutStew": "[pg]Kiha eyes up the array on the table with interest. [say: So, are we making some super-stew?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson2.KihaBoastsHerFire": "[pg][say: Ha! Of course, my fire burns as hot as I need it to, whenever I need it to!] Kiha says in triumphant glee. Despite your worries, it's going smoothly."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.AmilyFinishesDemo": "After Amily finishes demonstrating a similar level of efficacy cooking fish, she gives a brief once-over on heating other kinds of foods and then shifts to the topic of recipes."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.AmilyOffersExample": "[pg]Wary of this confidence, Amily gestures across the many ingredients they have. [say: How about an example of what you mean? Let's say you managed to scavenge all the things you see here, what would you decide to put into the meal?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.AmilyProposesRecipe": "[pg]Amily smiles wearily at the dragoness, searching for words. [say: I'll make a mostly simple recipe with just a few extra things added in, then take out a portion, and you can add in all the other extra things you would want. How about that?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.AmilySuggestsTasting": "[pg]Amily, on the verge of a seizure at the mere sight of it, suggests the pair taste-test her dish before they try Kiha's. [say: Save the best for last, you know?] she squeaks out. Fortunately, Kiha buys into the idea, and all three of you have a bite of Amily's home-cooking and are all delighted by it. It's a wholesome and enjoyable meal that you're glad to recall having from her a few occasions before!"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.BasicMealAdvice": "[pg][say: A lot of combinations surprised me over the years, but everyone knows the basic tried-and-true meals when options are limited or you're just not sure what to do. Honestly, I think even in the relative leisure of this camp, it's still nice to have some of the basic meals, like plain seared meat with some chunks of old bread cooked on the grease. Things can be pretty easy and efficient, but nice,] she explains."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.CharredMushRevealed": "[pg]The dragon pulls the spoon out, revealing charred mush she must have instinctively tried to incinerate rather than swallow."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.KihaBrowRaised": "[pg][say: All of it?] Kiha says, brow raised. [say: I-in varying amounts, of course.]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.KihaSmirksRebut": "[pg]Kiha smirks and proudly rebuts the idea. [say: I think if you've got the means to fly anywhere you want for ingredients and cook quickly and efficiently with your <b>breath</b>, there's no need to be so simple! I can easily get anything I want to toss into a recipe, so I employ that liberally. The kind of food only a restaurant in a well-supplied city would serve is what I can make myself!] That definitely explains how some strange flavors end up in everything she makes, now that you think about it."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.KihaThreatensTasteTest": "[pg]Kiha pulls her bowl over. [say: Now it's time to show you <b>my</b> cooking,] threatens the fearsome dragon. Amily sheepishly lifts her spoon, which shakes erratically as it nears the bowl. Kiha is oblivious to Amily's apprehension as she passes a spoon to you as well. In the name of fairness, you scoop up a bite and put it in your mouth. Your suicidal confidence misguidedly reassures Amily, who follows suit."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.KihaWatchesPrep": "[pg]Kiha nods and watches as the mouse-chef cobbles together a quick selection of savory, salty, and a little bitter veg as well. When both cooked and salted, the bitterness of the veg shifts to something pretty decent, even better when you have another savory component balancing with it. A well-thought-out combination is summarily prepped and set onto a plate, freeing Kiha to use the remainder of the meal as a base for her own concoction."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.QuietAdmissionMistake": "[pg][say: I made a mistake,] is all she says."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.StunnedWatchSeasoning": "[pg]You and Amily watch in stunned bewilderment as the scaled woman lives true to her word in adding at least some amount of every ingredient available to her into one single dish. The chopping, dicing, and flame-assisted components of this twisted alchemy only serve to suggest there is a kind of forethought involved, which disturbs the two of you even further. Could there be... method to such madness?"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.TerrorThenReassure": "[pg]A terror pierces your being. You remind yourself none of the ingredients Amily brought were poisonous, and gulp down the horrifying stew. Your mousy cooking instructor, on the other hand, immediately wretches before anything makes it too far in. You envy her. Slowly turning, you gaze at Kiha, who stares forward at nothing in particular, spoon still in her mouth."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson3.TranceBreaksAsServed": "[pg]The trance is finally broken when Kiha proudly places her creation down, poured with care into a bowl. The spring greens and lemon-grass cooked and floating in the otherwise unrecognizable mass look as though they have been scooped right out of the swamp Kiha came from--answering yet another question that once ate at the back of your mind. Now you know it isn't just swamp muck, though you aren't sure that helps."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson4.ChirpyAmilyRecovers": "[pg]Amily snaps to attention, somehow chirpy despite the near-death experience, saying, [say: It's nothing to worry about, Kiha! We'll cook smaller, simpler meals together. We can get to more complex dishes over time, and I'll help you learn to cook the kinds of foods you want!]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson4.ComfortHerShoulder": "[pg]You lay your hand on her shoulder, comforting the well-meaning accidental toxicologist."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson4.GaspBackToReality": "An involuntary gasp startles you as your body reconnects with reality. As the only one to have actually swallowed it, you seem to have blacked out, though only for a couple of minutes. The muttering of the girls rescues you from the grim thoughts the food had given you, as Kiha is sitting face-in-hands at the realization she can't cook."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson4.KihaReveresAmily": "[pg]Kiha looks up at the mouse as though she's been visited by a messiah and told her sins would all be forgotten. The girls embrace each-other, firmly securing their bond for many meals to come. Let's hope Amily teaches her enough before the next time Kiha tries cooking for you..."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaCookingLesson4.KihaTearfulApology": "[pg]Kiha turns to you, tears streaming down her face. [say: I'm sorry! I never realized how much danger I was putting you in. I just-- I wanted to make things <b>special</b>--because I can! I should! I--] She lays her face on the table in despair."
