  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.AdmitsFailure": "[pg][say: I-I fucked up, alright?] she finally says after a long silence, picking her head up to look you in the eye. [say: That's... that's what you came here to hear, isn't it? You want to hear me say it, don't you!? Well fine: you were right, and I was wrong. I can't just go kick down Lethice's door. I-I couldn't even get close.] You try to comfort her, but Kiha just turns her face sharply away, refusing to let you see her as she lets out what could have been a growl... or a sob."
