  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.AffirmSharedResolve": "[pg]You are. She is. All of you--anyone who hasn't given in to corruption. Anyone with the will and the strength to fight back. You tell her of everyone you've met in your travels, the few stalwart souls that still resist Lethice's hordes."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.CallOutForKiha": "You walk over to the ring of trees and call out for the dragoness."
