  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.PointAtSky": " in the sky. You point to them, telling Kiha to look. The dragoness does as you ask, following your pointing finger up to the sky. After a moment, though, she harrumphs and scowls at you."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.PointOutPatterns": " are beautiful. You spend a few minutes pointing to a few shapes and patterns in the sky, a warrior with a shield here, a proud centaur there--you even spot a dragon. Kiha listens with disinterest, rolling her eyes as you try to show her one of the last, immutable things of beauty left in the world. Even the demons, you say, cannot destroy the heavens."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.RedEyesGlance": "[pg]Her fire-red eyes glance up at you, though she neither moves nor responds. Without another word, you sit down beside her and wrap an arm around the dragoness's shoulders. To your surprise, she doesn't push you away. Indeed, you feel her tremble just a bit at your touch."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.RestrainSlapUrge": "[pg]A part of you wants to slap her, to shake her violently and tell her that no, she's wrong. Instead, you squeeze her tight against you and look up to the heavens. The dragoness's islet has a clear line of sight to the open air, a perfect place for the airborne predator to take off and land. But from here, you can clearly see the "
