  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaFriendlyGreeting.VisitKihaGrove": "Deciding to pay the pretty dragoness a visit, you make your way into the swamp and to the island grove Kiha called her home. To your delight, it seems Kiha has moved a fallen tree-trunk over the muck, creating a bridge from the bank to her island's shore. "
