  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.ApproachTreesWarily": "Warily, you approach the trees in the center. While you had guessed they were tightly packed by the darkness beyond them, you're surprised to see that the tall ones have grown so close together that their bark forms something of a solid, circular wall, and their canopies a thick roof. You're forced to circle around the grove, unable to find another means of ingress--even the tiniest of cracks between tree-trunks has been filled in with thick layers of dried mud.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.CalmDragoness": "You try to calm the dragoness down, explaining that you aren't one of Lethice's minions, that what you told her the first time around was true--that you're here to end the demon threat. Kiha doesn't seem to be buying it, though...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.FightKihaBegins": "You're fighting Kiha!"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.FireWallCharge": "The dragoness charges through her wall of fire, screaming with rage and swinging her deadly axe![pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.HearWingsAbove": "Intrigued, you're considering climbing the bark walls when you hear wings flapping above you. You look up just in time to see Kiha the dragoness plummeting down from on high, her axe arcing towards you![pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.HowlsDenial": "[say: Bullshit! You're working for the demons!] she howls. [say: First you try and make me go soft, tell me I don't need to fight, and then suddenly you're sneaking into my home. Well, no more!] Her axe swings around to point straight at you. [say: I've killed the Demon Queen's agents before, and if I have to, I'll kill you too, [name]!][pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.IrateStaredown": "Irate, you stare her down, and with a dangerous gentleness, remind her that you're here to crush the demons. Your fist tightens as, not unexpectedly, the erratic woman appears to hear none of it.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.IslandShoreArrival": "You drag yourself up onto the shore of the island and take a quick look around. The small isle is completely cut off from the swamp around it, surrounded on all sides by the thick, murky water you've been wading through. A small glade stands in the center of the land here, surrounded by the trees of the shoreline. In its center lies a coppice of tightly spaced trees. Surprisingly, it's clear of vines and webbing, quite unlike most of the swamp. This incongruity only reminds you that you've seen neither hide nor hair of any of the swamp's denizens in quite some time. The stillness and silence around the glade is unnerving, and for just a split second, you feel as if you're being watched.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaSpiderEventIntro.JourneyToSwamp": "You make your way to the swamp, and soon find yourself submerged waist-deep in a reeking marsh surrounded by tall, vine-covered trees, many of which support strands of thick gossamer webbing. You wander the bog for what seems like an eternity before you finally stumble across a small island, in what may well be the heart of the swamp. At this point, you're moments from saying to hell with it and going home, but... why not?[pg]"
