  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaTellsChildrenStory.KihaAsksYouSit": "Kiha walks over to you and says, [say: Could you please sit with me please, [name]? I want to tell my {0} a story,] she says. You tell her that it would be a wonderful idea! Kiha escorts you to her nest."
