  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihaXSalamander.SwampTrekArrival": "You make your way to the murky swamp. The going is rough, your progress impeded by the thick vines and webs that hang between the trees. Despite--or perhaps because of--your slow pace, you're surprised that nearly an hour goes by without you encountering anything of note. By now, you'd expect to have found a bit of usable silk, or a spider-girl, or anything."
