  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.KihasFirstClutch.PointStomachScowl": "[pg]You simply point at her stomach, and she looks at it before scowling at you. [say: For your information, this has nothing to do with food. It's woman's problems.] At your expression, she sighs. [say: I told you that I wasn't always like this, right? That the demons made me into what I am?] When you nod, she continues. [say: Well, what I used to be is a lizan--a{0}. When they made me into this thing, they changed a lot about me, but they didn't change a certain aspect.] She pats her swollen midriff for emphasis. [say: Unlike mammals, we lizans don't do that nasty monthly bleeding stuff. Instead, we have eggs form in our bellies when it's time; no sex happens, they come out the next day and it's over and done with. We have someone fuck us, and, well...]"
