  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SleepWith.EagerDragonessAgrees": "[pg]The draconic woman eagerly tells you, [say: Sure! I mean...! I-I don't mind sleeping with you if you're too scared to sleep by yourself or w-whatever.] She averts her gaze and a small smile spreads across her lips. Taking the girl's hand, you lead her to your [cabin] and hold the [if (builtcabin) {door|flap}] open for her. She eagerly enters, making herself comfortable on your bedding. Kiha stares at you, her tail impatiently thumping against [if (builtcabin) {floor|ground}]. [say: Are we going to sleep together or not?] "
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SleepWith.GetInBedBeside": "[pg]Nodding in response, you [if (!isnaked) {remove your clothes and }]get in your [bed] next to her. Wrapping an arm around Kiha, you pull her closer to you. Her body stiffens, her eyes quickly darting away from yours. You forcefully move the girl around, resting her lovely head upon your [chest]. Tenderly, you begin to run your hand through her fiery red hair and explain how you're grateful she's spending the night with you."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SleepWith.InviteKihaToBed": "You ask Kiha if she would like to join you in your bed for the night."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SleepWith.ShyGoodnightSnuggle": "[pg]Kiha mutters, [say: Really? I... Well... Goodnight!] She forcefully shuts her eyes, happily snuggling up against you. You're sure she is still awake, and you honestly state your feelings for her before shutting your eyes and drifting off to sleep yourself. "
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.DustOffCenterCamp": "[pg]You dust yourself off and head back to the center of camp under the dragoness's watchful gaze."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.DustOffReturnCamp": "[pg]You dust yourself off and head back to camp under the watchful gaze of the dragoness. You'll have to spend some time recovering."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.EmbarrassedEncouragement": "[pg]Her words cut deeper than you expected, and you remain silent. After a moment, Kiha huffs and looks away. [say: Look. If you really wanna get stronger, just keep trying. That's how you won my heart, wasn't it?] she adds, crossing her arms and blushing. [say: C-come on, let's get you healed up.]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.OffersMoreSparring": "[pg]Her words cut deeper than you expected, and you remain silent. After a moment, Kiha huffs and looks away. [say: Look. If you really wanna get stronger, I guess we could... keep doing this. Not that I'm doing it for you!] she adds, crossing her arms. [say: You're good target practice. That's all.]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.PityForKiha": "[pg]Oh, Kiha."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.PityForKihaAgain": "[pg]Oh, Kiha."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.TeasingChinPop": "[pg][say: Bam. You're dead!] she laughs, giving you a little pop on the chin before slinging it back over her shoulder. [say: Come on, [name]!] she jeers, [say: How the hell do you think you're going to beat the Demon Queen if you can't even beat me, huh?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.TeasingChinPopAgain": "[pg][say: Bam. You're dead!] she laughs, giving you a little pop on the chin before slinging it back over her shoulder. [say: Come on, [name]!] she jeers, [say: How the hell do you think you're going to beat the Demon Queen if you can't even beat me, huh?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.YieldsExhausted": "You can't take it anymore! You stumble away from the dragoness, but only make it a few feet before toppling over, landing right on your ass. Dazed, you can only sit there as Kiha casually walks over and presses the haft of her axe into your throat."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithFriendlyKihaLose.YieldsExhaustedAgain": "You can't take it anymore! You stumble away from the dragoness, but only make it a few feet before toppling over, landing right on your ass. Dazed, you can only sit there as Kiha casually walks over and presses the haft of her axe into your throat."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithKiha.ProposeMockFight": "You ask Kiha if she'd be willing to do a mock-fight with you. She arches an eyebrow at the suggestion, but quickly hefts her greataxe onto her shoulder and smirks at you. [say: You sure about this? I won't hold back--and I'll NEVER be defeated!]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.SparWithKiha.ReturnSmugGrin": "[pg]You return her smug grin and ready your [weaponName]."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.AnimalisticSnarl": "[pg]She snarls animalistically. [say: Oh, I fucking knew it! I say, 'hey, let's take on the demons', and all you want to do is fucking analyze my feelings. Of course you do! What good are you, anyway? What use is a champion who just sits around talking, huh? How is that going to fuck up Lethice, topple the demons? Huh?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.AskAboutBitsCut": "[pg]You ask her about those bits and pieces, but she cuts you off with a sweep of her arm, her claws flying so near your face you can feel the air moving. [say: Just shut up, damn it! I don't want to talk about it!] You shrug and ask her what she wants to talk about. She sneers. [say: Fine, if you're so keen on talking, let's talk about YOU!]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.AskDragonessChat": "You ask the dragoness if she wouldn't mind talking for a few minutes."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.AskSheTurnsNose": "[pg]You venture to ask her if she has anything to say, but she turns her nose up at the idea. [say: You think we're the same, don't you? That we both had it SO tough? Well, you're wrong! Just because you helped me out ONCE doesn't mean we're all buddy-buddy, and it sure as hell doesn't mean we're the same. So... so just fuck off, alright!?] she screams before thrusting into the air and flying off."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.CalmDemonQueen": "[pg]You try to calm her, telling her you just aren't ready to take down the demon queen. She laughs maniacally, so hard that a bit of red-hot fire blows out her mouth. [say: Oh, of course not! You wouldn't be ready--you haven't sat on your ass enough yet, have you! Well let me tell you a little bit about my feelings then, since you're so god-damn eager! I'm done waiting around! Those demons ruined my life, and I'm fucking done waiting. I want vengeance, and I want it RIGHT FUCKING NOW!]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.ClawedHandSwipe": "[pg]She waves a clawed hand your way, making you stumble back or else lose your face. [say: You keep saying you're some high and mighty champion out to stop the demons! Well where's the fucking proof, huh? It's all talk with you! Why the hell aren't we out there FIGHTING!? We should be kicking in Lethice's front door, not pussy-footing around here TALKING about our fucking FEELINGS or some shit! Come on, if you're so strong you can knock me on my ass, you and I together ought to be able to do SOMETHING about this fucking bitch! Right?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.CoaxDragonAgain": "You sit the dragoness down once again, and gently try to coax a little more out of her. Surely she's got more to tell, after all. Before you've even finished your request, however, the dragoness snarls and lets out a little gout of flame, ending just before your nose."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.DemonsMadeWarrior": "[pg][say: But look at what they made me,] she says, grinning. [say: The demons wanted the perfect warrior--the next generation of demon soldiers. Well, they got the first part right,] she says, baring her fangs and claws menacingly. [say: Now that I'm free, I just need to find that bitch Lethice and shove a claw right up her ass... for my people.]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.DragonessBlastsOff": "[pg]Before you can answer the dragoness, she blasts off the ground and flies off, hurtling over the treetops with her axe firmly in hand."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.DragonessLeapsAway": "[pg]Before you can answer her claim, the dragoness inclines her head to you and leaps into the air, disappearing into the dense foliage."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.GlanceSilencesYou": "[pg]You communicate your understanding, though a quick glance from the dragoness forestalls speech. [say: When the demons came, I would have tried to fight. We all would have. But somehow... somehow they won. We must have been fools. If we had trained harder, fought better... I could... could still remember who I was...]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.GodDammitKiha": "[pg]God dammit, Kiha."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.HissDoneTalking": "[pg][say: Dammit, [name]!] she hisses, waving away the smoke. [say: I'm fucking done talking! Why the hell do you keep this shit up, huh? All this talk and talk and talk! You keep coming here, talking your precious morals and acting like you ACTUALLY give a shit about me. Well, fucking stop!]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.HopeSheStaysSafe": "[pg]You hope she doesn't get herself in trouble, but there's not much you can really do about it right now..."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.HumorDragonAgain": "[pg]Wait, didn't you do this already? But, you decide to humor the dragoness, and start to tell her a little bit about the village you grew up in, training to be champion, and your eventual arrival in the land of Mareth. The dragoness listens silently, motionlessly, simply eyeing you as you speak. When you finish, culminating your story in first meeting her, Kiha only nods slightly."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.KihaCrossesArms": "[pg]Kiha crosses her arms contemptuously. [say: Oh, you're still all talk! Talking doesn't get anybody anywhere, dammit! Have you ever tried talking to a demon? All it does is give them more time to find a way to fuck you.] You sigh and ask her to just humor you. She rolls her eyes, but doesn't refuse you. That's a start, at least."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.KihaSpeaksFirst": "You try to talk to Kiha again, but she starts speaking a moment before you do: [say: I'm done listening to you ramble on about yourself,] she snaps, glowering at you. [say: I feel like talking about ME, and you're going to shut up and listen. Got it?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.ReclineAskAboutHer": "[pg]Reclining near the dragoness, you ask her a little bit about herself. Innocent questions, really--where she was born, about her parents, anything she can tell you. The dragon huffs, breathing out a little cloud of smoke. [say: Fucking idiot. I told you that I don't remember, okay? Just a few... images before the demons took me.]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.SheTrailsThenFire": "[pg]She trails off for a moment. You're about to speak, but she suddenly blows a great cone of fire into the air, illuminating the dark swamp with a pillar of fire."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.SignsOfProgress": "[pg]Maybe... just maybe... this is progress?"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.SuppressGrinAgree": "[pg]You suppress a grin and agree. She gives you a surprisingly approving nod, and begins to speak: [say: I was born a lizan, destined to be a warrior--a great warrior. I'd have fought in countless battles, slain my tribe's enemies by the thousands... and I would never have been defeated.]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.TalkToFriendlyKiha.TakenAbackOutburst": "[pg]You're utterly taken aback by the dragoness's sudden outburst. Before, it seemed like she was more interested in defending herself--hiding, really--than fighting. What's brought this change on?"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.ApproachDragonessLover": "When you approach your dragoness lover, a warm smile spreads across her dark features. She gives you a playful punch on the shoulder and laughs, [say: Hey, doofus. You need something--maybe a little dragon loving?] she adds with a wink."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.BellySlightlySwollen": "<b>Her belly appears to be a bit swollen.</b>"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.BellySwollenWithEggs": "[pg]<b>Kiha's belly is noticeably swollen and distended. She's got eggs in her womb ready to be fertilized; if you aren't careful when you have sex, you could fertilize her and become a father.</b>"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.BiggerThanFullTerm": "<b>Her belly is even bigger than the average belly size at end of a typical human pregnancy.</b>"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.EightMonthsPregnant": "<b>Her belly is comparable to being eight months into pregnancy.</b>"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.HeyDoofusGrin": "[say: Hey, doofus,] she grins. [say: Just couldn't resist seeing me for another minute, could you? Well, I can hardly blame you...]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.ImpossibleNotToNotice": "<b>It's impossible to not notice her pregnancy. The size of her belly has taken its toll on her. She is about to lay a clutch of eggs soon.</b>"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.NineMonthsPregnant": "<b>Her belly is comparable to being nine months into pregnancy. It wouldn't take very long until she eventually lays a clutch of eggs.</b>"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.SixMonthsPregnant": "<b>Her belly is comparable to being six months into pregnancy.</b>"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarmLoverKihaIntro.SwampFamiliarTerritory": "While exploring the swamp, you find yourself entering the familiar territory of your dragon-girl lover. With a newfound spring in your step, you wind your way through the dense foliage to the cluster of trees Kiha calls her home. Before you can even call out her name, you hear a rush of air high above you, and a moment later Kiha herself lands lightly before you, a small smile on her dark features."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarnKihaOfHerImpendingDemise.DismissiveSmirk": "She smirks. [say: Come on, [name]. What do you think I am, stupid?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarnKihaOfHerImpendingDemise.DriderLoomsBehind": "By now, the bigger of the two driders is directly behind Kiha, looming over her with a wicked grin on her lips. You try to stammer out another warning, but too late! She hauls Kiha off the ground by her weapon arm and slaps a wad of wet webbing into the angry woman's mouth, leaving the dragoness virtually defenseless and allowing you to slip free. You tumble to the ground but now your one-time executioner is moments away from being tossed to the spider-morphs gathering around the spinney of trees, all waiting for their chance at the dragoness.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarnKihaOfHerImpendingDemise.KihaSnapsQuestion": "[say: You!] Kiha snaps, tearing the webs away and grabbing her axe, [say: Why the hell did you do that?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarnKihaOfHerImpendingDemise.SpiderHordeFight": "[pg]You're now fighting the spider horde!"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarnKihaOfHerImpendingDemise.StabPaleTemple": "Before the drider can cast Kiha into the mob, you leap, jabbing into the pale spider-morph's temple with every ounce of muscle you can manage. Staggered by your blow, the drider drops Kiha at your feet and stumbles back. The other members of the mob, however, continue to advance around their stunned leader.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarnKihaOfHerImpendingDemise.TalkLaterAnswer": "[say: Talk later!] you answer."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WarnKihaOfHerImpendingDemise.WarningShout": "[say: Kiha! Behind you!] you shout, desperately pointing at the group of monsters closing in behind her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.BitterPersonalLoss": "[pg]Even though it was just a mock match, you can clearly see the dragoness took the loss as a personal failure. She flops back down, unable to rise again, and curses at herself. [say: If... if I can't defeat you, [name], how the hell am I supposed to beat Lethice?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.BitterPersonalLossAgain": "[pg]Even though it was just a mock match, you can clearly see the dragoness took the loss as a personal failure. She flops back down, unable to rise again, and curses at herself. [say: If... if I can't defeat you, [name], how the hell am I supposed to beat Lethice?]"
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.FlusteredFliesOff": "[pg][say: W-what are you doing!?] she starts, pushing away. [say: You-- you dumbass!] Face as red as her scales, she launches into the air and flies off."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.FlusteredStormsOff": "[pg][say: W-what are you doing!?] she starts, pushing away. [say: You-- you dumbass!] Face as red as her scales, she storms off to the other side of camp."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.HelpsHerUp": "[pg]While you can't answer her question, you can give her a hand up. She's surprisingly light for her size and build, though--when you pull her up, she tumbles forward into your arms."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.HelpsHerUpAgain": "[pg]While you can't answer her question, you can give her a hand up. She's surprisingly light for her size and build, though--when you pull her up, she tumbles forward into your arms."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.KihaSlumpsOnRock": "Kiha sways back and forth for a moment, then drops her axe with numb hands. As soon as she does, the hot glow of the weapon's cutting edge fades to silver, and the weapon lands with a heavy 'thunk' in the dirt. The dragoness drops to her knees and slumps back against a rock, her limbs trembling weakly as she tries to rise. [say: You... you... haven't... beaten me,] she mutters, even though it's quite clear that you have."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.KihaSlumpsOnTree": "Kiha sways back and forth for a moment, then drops her axe with numb hands. As soon as she does, the hot glow of the weapon's cutting edge fades to silver, and the weapon lands with a heavy 'thunk' in the dirt. The dragoness drops to her knees and slumps back against a tree, her limbs trembling weakly as she tries to rise. [say: You... you... haven't... beaten me,] she mutters, even though it's quite clear that you have."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.SighReturnCamp": "[pg]You sigh and head back to camp."
  "Scenes.Kihafollowerscene.WinSparWithKiha.SighReturnStuff": "[pg]You sigh and head back towards your stuff."
}
